Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/FreeMixer/mod-host/tree/freemixer
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: mod-host
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: jackd2 | pipewire-jack
Description: LV2 host for JACK, controllable over a socket
 mod-host loads LV2 plugins as JACK clients and is driven over a TCP socket
 or an interactive command line. This build carries the patches listed in
 the README of the FreeMixer fork, each one a pull request to
 mod-audio/mod-host.

Package: libmod-host-protocol0
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: mod-host socket server, line protocol and command dispatch
 The socket server, the line protocol and the command dispatch of mod-host,
 without any plugin format behind them, as a shared library, for hosts that
 answer the mod-host protocol with a plugin backend of their own.

Package: mod-host-protocol-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libmod-host-protocol0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Provides: libmod-host-protocol-dev
Conflicts: libmod-host-protocol-dev
Replaces: libmod-host-protocol-dev
Description: mod-host protocol library, development files
 Headers, the pkg-config file and the backend scenarios of
 libmod-host-protocol, for hosts that answer the mod-host protocol with a
 plugin backend of their own.
